  "Body": {
    "ContentType": "html",
    "Content": "<p>Azure Functions support for Java 21 on Linux is now in preview.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>You can now develop apps using Java 21 locally and deploy them to all Azure Functions plans on Linux.&nbsp; Azure Functions support for Java 21 on Windows will be added soon.&nbsp;Learn more about <a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/azure-functions/update-language-versions?tabs=azure-portal%2Cwindows&amp;pivots=programming-language-java#update-the-language-version\" title=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/azure-functions/update-language-versions?tabs=azure-portal%2cwindows&amp;pivots=programming-language-java#update-the-language-version\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">updating your app to Java 21</a>.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>For more info:&nbsp;<br>\r\n<a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/java/openjdk/download#openjdk-21\" title=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/java/openjdk/download#openjdk-21\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Learn more about Java 21</a>&nbsp;<br>\r\n<a href=\"https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/azure-functions/supported-languages#languages-by-runtime-version\" title=\"https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/azure-functions/supported-languages#languages-by-runtime-version\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">More information about Azure Functions Supported Languages</a>&nbsp;</p>\r\n",
    "Markdown": "Azure Functions support for Java 21 on Linux is now in preview.\n\nYou can now develop apps using Java 21 locally and deploy them to all Azure Functions plans on Linux. Azure Functions support for Java 21 on Windows will be added soon. Learn more about updating your app to Java 21 .\n\nFor more info:\n\nLearn more about Java 21\n\nMore information about Azure Functions Supported Languages"
  },
